---
import {
  claimState,
  h138Metrics,
  nextDecisionNodes,
  openEvoProgramLinks,
  openEvoProgramSource,
  programResultLabels,
  programStageLabels,
  programTimeline,
  type ProgramLocale,
} from '../../data/openEvoWebShopProgram';

interface Props { locale?: ProgramLocale }
const { locale = 'zh' } = Astro.props;
const isZh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (zh: string, en: string) => isZh ? zh : en;
const f = new Intl.NumberFormat(locale === 'zh' ? 'zh-CN' : 'en-US', { maximumFractionDigits: 6 });
const plotMin = -0.1;
const plotMax = 0.15;
const plotLeft = 116;
const plotWidth = 390;
const plotX = (value: number) => plotLeft + ((value - plotMin) / (plotMax - plotMin)) * plotWidth;
const plotRows = h138Metrics.filter((metric) => metric.ci !== null);
const hasHistoricalAppendix = Astro.slots.has('historical');
---

<article class="paper-report" data-program-report data-ui-audit="contrast layout overflow" data-testid="openevo-webshop-program-report">
  <header class="paper-header" id="abstract">
    <p class="kicker">OPENEVO × WEBSHOP · {openEvoProgramSource.checkedAt}</p>
    <h1>{t('OpenEvo 在 WebShop 上能否真正实现自进化？', 'Can OpenEvo actually self-evolve on WebShop?')}</h1>
    <p class="abstract"><strong>{t('截至当前实验，答案是：还没有建立这个结论。', 'The current evidence does not yet establish that claim.')}</strong> {t(
      '我们已经证明真实的 WebShop 闭环可以运行：智能体执行任务、产生成功经验、更新参数、保存并重载 adapter，再回到环境评估。Qwen2.5-3B/7B 也能够在受控任务上产生可学习成功经验，训练目标能够被拟合；但更新后的模型尚未在未参与训练的新 WebShop 任务上表现出稳定、可重复的正向迁移。',
      'The real WebShop loop works: the agent acts, produces successful experience, updates parameters, saves and reloads an adapter, and returns to the environment for evaluation. Qwen2.5-3B/7B can also produce learnable successes on controlled tasks and fit training targets; however, the updated model has not shown stable, repeatable positive transfer to unseen WebShop tasks.'
    )}</p>
    <p class="thesis">{t(
      '因此当前最重要的问题已经从“能不能训练”转成“为什么已经获得并拟合的经验，没有稳定转化成下一批任务上的更好决策”。',
      'The central question has therefore shifted from “can it train?” to “why does acquired and fitted experience fail to become better decisions on the next tasks?”'
    )}</p>
    <div class="claim-line" aria-label={t('当前证据链', 'Current evidence chain')}>
      <span>{t('获得成功经验', 'Acquire success')} <b>✓</b></span>
      <span>{t('参数更新', 'Parameter update')} <b>✓</b></span>
      <span>{t('训练拟合', 'Training fit')} <b>✓</b></span>
      <span>{t('新任务迁移', 'Fresh-task transfer')} <b>?</b></span>
      <span>{t('可重复自进化', 'Repeatable self-evolution')} <b>?</b></span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav class="paper-nav" aria-label={t('报告目录', 'Report contents')}>
    <a href="#method">{t('实验怎么做', 'Experiment')}</a>
    <a href="#results">{t('数据', 'Data')}</a>
    <a href="#interpretation">{t('推断', 'Inference')}</a>
    <a href="#next-experiment">{t('下一步', 'Next')}</a>
    <a href="#methods">{t('方法与来源', 'Methods')}</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="paper-section" id="method" aria-labelledby="method-title">
    <p class="section-number">01 · EXPERIMENT</p>
    <h2 id="method-title">{t('OpenEvo 怎么在 WebShop 上做实验', 'How OpenEvo is tested on WebShop')}</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{t(
      'WebShop 给智能体一个购物目标。模型根据网页 observation 选择可执行 action，环境返回新的页面状态与终局分数。OpenEvo 的核心实验不是单次得分，而是检验“经验能否跨任务变成能力”。',
      'WebShop gives the agent a shopping goal. The model chooses executable actions from page observations, and the environment returns new page states and a terminal score. The OpenEvo experiment is not about one score; it tests whether experience can become capability across tasks.'
    )}</p>
    <ol class="experiment-loop">
      <li><span>1</span><div><strong>{t('让 base agent 在 WebShop 中真实行动', 'Run the base agent in WebShop')}</strong><p>{t('记录 goal、observation、action、状态变化、reward，以及 parser/runtime 是否有效。', 'Record goal, observation, action, state transition, reward, and parser/runtime validity.')}</p></div></li>
      <li><span>2</span><div><strong>{t('从自然交互中筛出成功经验', 'Select successful endogenous experience')}</strong><p>{t('H0 已证明成功轨迹并非不存在：128 次尝试中 96 次科学有效，得到 28 个合格正例。', 'H0 established that successes exist: 96 of 128 attempts were scientifically valid and yielded 28 qualified positives.')}</p></div></li>
      <li><span>3</span><div><strong>{t('把经验写回模型参数', 'Write experience back into parameters')}</strong><p>{t('当前主线使用真实 SD-LoRA 参数更新；训练产物被保存、重载，并与同一 base 做可比评估。', 'The current line uses real SD-LoRA parameter updates; artifacts are saved, reloaded, and evaluated comparably against the same base.')}</p></div></li>
      <li><span>4</span><div><strong>{t('在未参与训练的新任务上评估', 'Evaluate on unseen tasks')}</strong><p>{t('关键指标不是 loss 是否下降，而是新任务 closed-loop score 是否相对 base 提升。', 'The key metric is not lower loss but whether closed-loop score improves versus base on unseen tasks.')}</p></div></li>
      <li><span>5</span><div><strong>{t('只有迁移与保留都成立，才叫自进化', 'Call it self-evolution only after transfer and retention')}</strong><p>{t('真正的命题要求 acquisition → update → retention → forward transfer 能够重复发生，而不是只得到一个 adapter 文件。', 'The actual claim requires acquisition → update → retention → forward transfer to repeat, not merely the existence of an adapter file.')}</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section" id="results" aria-labelledby="results-title">
    <p class="section-number">02 · RESULTS</p>
    <h2 id="results-title">{t('数据告诉我们什么', 'What the data says')}</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{t('下面只保留真正改变研究判断的里程碑；完整 Phase G–H1.38 谱系放在附录。', 'Only milestones that changed the research judgment are kept in the main text; the complete Phase G–H1.38 lineage is in the appendix.')}</p>

    <div class="table-region" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={t('关键实验里程碑表，可横向滚动', 'Key experiment milestones, horizontally scrollable')}>
      <table class="milestone-table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">{t('实验', 'Experiment')}</th><th scope="col">{t('关键数据', 'Key data')}</th><th scope="col">{t('得到的结论', 'What it establishes')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">H0</th><td>128 {t('次尝试；96 有效；28 个合格正例', 'attempts; 96 valid; 28 qualified positives')}</td><td>{t('3B base 能产生可学习的自然成功经验。', 'The 3B base can generate learnable endogenous successes.')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">H1.29</th><td>64 BASE / SELF {t('尝试；无 score gain', 'attempts; no score gain')}</td><td>{t('“自生成成功经验 + 真实 SD-LoRA”没有建立 fresh-task 收益。', 'Self-generated success plus real SD-LoRA did not establish fresh-task benefit.')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">H1.37</th><td>512 {t('次尝试；61/64 complete-valid tasks；244 complete-valid pairs', 'attempts; 61/64 complete-valid tasks; 244 complete-valid pairs')}</td><td>{t('更大的全新任务面板仍未解析出正向迁移，且统计功效不足。', 'A larger fresh-task panel still did not resolve positive transfer and remained underpowered.')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">H1.38A-C</th><td>768 {t('次尝试；764 科学有效', 'attempts; 764 scientifically valid')}</td><td>{t('固定成功记录总数后，提高训练 task identity 数没有产生单调收益。', 'With success count fixed, increasing training task identity count did not produce monotonic benefit.')}</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <figure class="evidence-ladder" aria-labelledby="ladder-title ladder-caption">
      <h3 id="ladder-title">{t('目前走到了自进化的哪一步？', 'How far has the self-evolution claim progressed?')}</h3>
      <ol>
        <li><span class="state established">{t('成立', 'Established')}</span><strong>{t('运行机制', 'Runtime mechanism')}</strong><p>{t('真实模型、环境、训练、adapter 保存/重载与评估链路可执行。', 'Real model, environment, training, adapter save/reload, and evaluation are executable.')}</p></li>
        <li><span class="state established">{t('成立', 'Established')}</span><strong>{t('经验供给', 'Experience supply')}</strong><p>{t('受控任务上存在合格自然成功轨迹。', 'Qualified endogenous successes exist on controlled tasks.')}</p></li>
        <li><span class="state established">{t('成立', 'Established')}</span><strong>{t('经验内化 / 拟合', 'Internalization / fit')}</strong><p>{t('成功监督能够改变参数与训练拟合。', 'Successful supervision can change parameters and training fit.')}</p></li>
        <li><span class="state open">{t('未建立', 'Not established')}</span><strong>{t('闭环迁移', 'Closed-loop transfer')}</strong><p>{t('尚未证明 adapter 在未见 WebShop 任务上稳定优于同一 base。', 'No stable advantage over the same base has been established on unseen WebShop tasks.')}</p></li>
        <li><span class="state open">{t('未建立', 'Not established')}</span><strong>{t('自进化闭环', 'Self-evolution loop')}</strong><p>{t('因此还不能声称已经形成可重复的 acquisition → update → retention → forward transfer。', 'Therefore a repeatable acquisition → update → retention → forward transfer loop cannot yet be claimed.')}</p></li>
      </ol>
      <figcaption id="ladder-caption">{t('训练成功、参数变化和任务能力提升是三个不同事实；本页始终分开报告。', 'Training success, parameter change, and task-capability improvement are distinct facts and are reported separately.')}</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="subsection-heading">
      <p class="sub-kicker">H1.38A-C · FROZEN PANEL</p>
      <h3>{t('最后一个问题：是不是成功经验覆盖的任务还不够多？', 'Final question: did successful experience simply cover too few tasks?')}</h3>
      <p>{t(
        '固定 16 条成功记录。task identity 指一个具体 WebShop 任务实例；D4、D8、D16 分别使用来自 4、8、16 个训练任务实例的记录。',
        'Fix 16 successful records. A task identity is one specific WebShop task instance; D4, D8, and D16 draw their records from 4, 8, or 16 training task instances.'
      )}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="table-region" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={t('H1.38A-C 主结果表，可横向滚动', 'H1.38A-C primary result table, horizontally scrollable')}>
      <table>
        <caption>{t('Base、D4、D8、D16 的冻结比较', 'Frozen comparison of Base, D4, D8, and D16')}</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">{t('实验臂', 'Arm')}</th><th scope="col">{t('有效/尝试', 'Valid/attempts')}</th><th scope="col">{t('平均分', 'Mean score')}</th><th scope="col">{t('相对 Base 配对差异', 'Paired delta vs Base')}</th><th scope="col">95% CI</th><th scope="col">p</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>{h138Metrics.map((metric) => <tr><th scope="row">{metric.label}</th><td>{metric.valid}/{metric.attempts}</td><td>{f.format(metric.mean)}</td><td>{metric.delta === null ? '—' : `${metric.delta >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${f.format(metric.delta)}`}</td><td>{metric.ci === null ? '—' : `[${f.format(metric.ci[0])}, ${f.format(metric.ci[1])}]`}</td><td>{metric.p === null ? '—' : metric.p}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="validity-note"><strong>764 / 768 {t('科学有效', 'scientifically valid')}.</strong> {t('4 次无效尝试全部来自 D4 的 parser/fallback；runtime invalid 为 0。', 'All four invalid attempts are D4 parser/fallback cases; runtime invalid is zero.')}</p>

    <figure class="ci-figure" aria-labelledby="ci-title ci-caption">
      <div class="figure-heading"><h3 id="ci-title">{t('相对 Base 的配对差异', 'Paired differences versus Base')}</h3><p>{t('点为配对差异，横线为 task-cluster 95% CI；竖线表示零差异。', 'Points are paired differences, horizontal lines are task-cluster 95% CIs, and the vertical line marks zero difference.')}</p></div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 760 230" role="img" aria-label={t('D4、D8、D16 的差异与置信区间均跨零', 'D4, D8, and D16 differences and confidence intervals, all crossing zero')}>
        <line class="axis" x1={plotLeft} y1="194" x2={plotLeft + plotWidth} y2="194" />
        <line class="zero" x1={plotX(0)} y1="28" x2={plotX(0)} y2="194" />
        {[-0.1, -0.05, 0, 0.05, 0.1, 0.15].map((tick) => <g><line class="tick" x1={plotX(tick)} y1="194" x2={plotX(tick)} y2="200" /><text class="tick-label" x={plotX(tick)} y="218" text-anchor="middle">{tick === 0 ? '0' : tick.toFixed(2)}</text></g>)}
        {plotRows.map((metric, index) => {
          const y = 58 + index * 52;
          const ci = metric.ci!;
          const delta = metric.delta!;
          return <g><text class="arm-label" x="22" y={y + 5}>{metric.label}</text><line class="interval" x1={plotX(ci[0])} y1={y} x2={plotX(ci[1])} y2={y} /><line class="interval-cap" x1={plotX(ci[0])} y1={y - 7} x2={plotX(ci[0])} y2={y + 7} /><line class="interval-cap" x1={plotX(ci[1])} y1={y - 7} x2={plotX(ci[1])} y2={y + 7} /><circle class="estimate" cx={plotX(delta)} cy={y} r="5" /><text class="value-label" x="742" y={y + 5} text-anchor="end">{delta >= 0 ? '+' : ''}{f.format(delta)} [{f.format(ci[0])}, {f.format(ci[1])}]</text></g>;
        })}
      </svg>
      <figcaption id="ci-caption">{t('D16 的平均分 0.201063 是最高观测值，但其 paired Δ = +0.055646，95% CI [-0.019354, 0.131521]，p = 0.1735。最高观测均值不是已确认提升；D4 → D8 → D16 的 delta 也不单调。', 'D16 has the highest observed mean at 0.201063, but paired Δ = +0.055646, 95% CI [-0.019354, 0.131521], p = 0.1735. The highest observed mean is not a confirmed improvement, and the D4 → D8 → D16 deltas are not monotonic.')}</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section" id="interpretation" aria-labelledby="interpretation-title">
    <p class="section-number">03 · INFERENCE</p>
    <h2 id="interpretation-title">{t('我们由此推断：瓶颈越来越不像“数据还不够多”', 'Inference: the bottleneck looks less like “not enough data”')}</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{t('这不是对某一个组件的最终因果判决，而是连续冻结实验后研究空间的收缩。', 'This is not a final causal verdict on one component; it is a narrowing of the hypothesis space after successive frozen experiments.')}</p>

    <dl class="interpretation-list">
      <div><dt>{t('已经支持', 'Supported')}</dt><dd><ul>{claimState.confirmed[locale].map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('简单解释被削弱', 'Simple explanations weakened')}</dt><dd><p>{t('只改 prompt、target 格式、carrier、horizon、action admissibility、标签精度，或只增加训练 task identity 数，都没有在各自冻结协议中建立稳定 fresh-task gain。', 'Changing only prompt, target format, carrier, horizon, action admissibility, label precision, or training task-identity count has not established stable fresh-task gain under the corresponding frozen protocols.')}</p></dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('仍然未知', 'Still unknown')}</dt><dd><ul>{claimState.unknown[locale].map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></dd></div>
    </dl>

    <div class="inference-block" role="note">
      <p class="sub-kicker">{t('当前工作假设，不是已证实结论', 'Working hypothesis, not an established result')}</p>
      <p>{t('经验已经存在，而且能够被拟合；真正欠缺的是“在对应决策状态中把经验转成正确动作”的稳定能力。因此下一步优先区分 update rule 与 state / action / credit alignment，而不是继续堆数据量、rank、学习率、epoch 或 horizon。', 'Experience exists and can be fitted; what remains missing is the stable ability to turn it into the right action in the corresponding decision state. The next step should therefore distinguish the update rule from state/action/credit alignment instead of continuing to tune data volume, rank, learning rate, epochs, or horizon.')}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section" id="next-experiment" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <p class="section-number">04 · NEXT</p>
    <h2 id="next-title">{t('下一版 OpenEvo 应该怎么改', 'How the next OpenEvo iteration should change')}</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{t('优先级不是“再跑更多”，而是让每一次新实验能定位一个明确瓶颈。', 'The priority is not “run more,” but to make each new experiment identify one specific bottleneck.')}</p>

    <ol class="priority-list">
      <li><span>P1</span><div><strong>{t('同一份经验，只换更新方法', 'Same experience, change only the update method')}</strong><p>{nextDecisionNodes[0].change[locale]}</p><p>{t('评估必须拆开 acquisition、retention 与 untouched transfer；如果结果分化，瓶颈更接近 update rule。', 'Evaluation must separate acquisition, retention, and untouched transfer; divergence would point more strongly to the update rule.')}</p></div></li>
      <li><span>P2</span><div><strong>{t('把决策状态变成一等训练对象', 'Make decision state a first-class training object')}</strong><p>{t('experience schema 应明确保存可执行 action 集、结构化页面/目标状态、动作 credit、动作后的状态变化与失败恢复点。训练后要检查“在对应状态会不会用”，而不只是 token likelihood 是否提高。', 'The experience schema should explicitly store executable actions, structured page/goal state, action credit, post-action state change, and recovery points. Evaluation should test whether the model uses the experience in the matching state, not only whether token likelihood increases.')}</p></div></li>
      <li><span>P3</span><div><strong>{t('把自进化拆成五项账本', 'Track self-evolution as five separate ledgers')}</strong><p>{t('每轮分别记录 acquisition、update validity、retention、forward transfer、invalidity/compute。只有多轮都通过，才使用“self-evolution”作为能力结论。', 'Each round should separately record acquisition, update validity, retention, forward transfer, and invalidity/compute. Use “self-evolution” as a capability claim only after repeated rounds pass all of them.')}</p></div></li>
      <li><span>P4</span><div><strong>{t('method control 仍为 null 时，再做更大的结构改造', 'Escalate to larger architectural changes only if the method control remains null')}</strong><p>{t('届时再预注册更强 base、显式 retrieval/memory、agent decomposition 或 credit assignment；不要同时改变模型、数据、prompt、方法和任务面板。', 'Then preregister a stronger base, explicit retrieval/memory, agent decomposition, or credit assignment; do not change model, data, prompt, method, and task panel simultaneously.')}</p></div></li>
    </ol>

    <p class="handoff-boundary"><strong>H1.38B.</strong> {t('目前只有 goal/design handoff：没有 accepted preregistration、没有授权、没有执行、没有 sealed result。这里写的是下一步设计，不是已经完成的实验结果。', 'Only a goal/design handoff exists: there is no accepted preregistration, authorization, execution, or sealed result. This is a next-step design, not an executed experimental result.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section secondary" id="methods" aria-labelledby="methods-title">
    <p class="section-number">05 · METHODS</p>
    <h2 id="methods-title">{t('方法、有效性与来源', 'Methods, validity, and provenance')}</h2>
    <details><summary>{t('查看冻结设计与证据来源', 'View frozen design and evidence sources')}</summary><div class="details-body">
      <dl class="method-list">
        <div><dt>{t('H1.38 冻结设计', 'H1.38 frozen design')}</dt><dd>{t('四臂 × 48 个 task × 4 个 seeds；每个 adapter arm 固定 16 条成功记录。', 'Four arms × 48 tasks × four seeds; each adapter arm uses 16 successful records.')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('训练任务来源', 'Training-task source')}</dt><dd>{t('D4/D8/D16 分别来自 4/8/16 个 task identity。', 'D4/D8/D16 draw from 4/8/16 task identities.')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('推断单位', 'Inference unit')}</dt><dd>{t('相对 Base 的配对差异使用 task-cluster inference。', 'Paired differences versus Base use task-cluster inference.')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('有效性', 'Validity')}</dt><dd>{t('764/768 有效；4 次 D4 parser/fallback-invalid。', '764/768 valid; four D4 parser/fallback-invalid attempts.')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('冻结快照', 'Frozen snapshot')}</dt><dd><code>{openEvoProgramSource.branch}@{openEvoProgramSource.commit}</code><br/><code>{openEvoProgramSource.campaign}</code></dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p>{t('静态网页不是实时科学状态的权威。实时状态应按实际实验 branch → current-campaign.json → 最新 reconciliation/result 解析。', 'This static page is not the authority for live scientific state. Resolve live state from the actual experiment branch → current-campaign.json → latest reconciliation/result.')}</p>
      <ul class="source-list"><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.report}>{t('项目总报告', 'Program report')}</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.ledger}>{t('机器可读账本', 'Machine-readable ledger')}</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.reconciliation}>H1.38A-C reconciliation</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.campaign}>current-campaign.json</a></li></ul>
    </div></details>
    <div class="print-only print-methods"><p><strong>{t('冻结快照：', 'Frozen snapshot: ')}</strong><code>{openEvoProgramSource.branch}@{openEvoProgramSource.commit}</code></p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section appendix" id="appendix" aria-labelledby="appendix-title">
    <p class="section-number">06 · APPENDIX</p>
    <h2 id="appendix-title">{t('完整实验谱系', 'Complete experimental lineage')}</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{t('这里保留审计深度，但不让内部 H 编号主导正文阅读。', 'Audit depth is preserved here without letting internal H-numbers dominate the main reading path.')}</p>
    <details data-testid="lineage-appendix"><summary>{t(`附录 A：Phase G–H1.38 完整谱系（${programTimeline.length} 个节点）`, `Appendix A: complete Phase G–H1.38 lineage (${programTimeline.length} nodes)`)}</summary><ol class="lineage-list">
